irts add a neat finish for boys and dads without feeling stiff.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Styling pieces not included:</strong> White shorts, sheer cover-up, sandals, watch, and hair accessories shown in the photos are styling only and were intentionally excluded from this listing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels bright, breezy, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Boy Shirt","Button Front Shirt","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Collared Shirt","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father L","Father M","Father Shirt","Father XL","Floral","Four-Role Matching","Girl Dress","Gray","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1039775411564.html","Hydrangea","Hydrangea Floral","Lavender","Lavender Floral","Lavender Hydrangea","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Mommy and Me","Mother 2XL","Mother Dress","Mother L","Mother M","Mother XL","Multicolor","Purple","Purple Floral","Resort","Sets","Short Sleeve Shirt","Shoulder Strap Dress","Sleeveless Dress","Summer","Summer Family Matching Set","Vacation","Watercolor Floral","White"],"seo":{"title":"Lavender Hydrangea Family Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Purple floral family matching set with strap dresses and collared shirts for moms, dads, girls & boys. Sizes 2Y-10Y, Mother M-2XL, Father M-3XL."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Outfit Sets"},"options":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9618044420193","name":"Type","position":1,"values":["Dress","Shirt"],"optionValues":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6143851429985","name":"Dress","hasVariants":true},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6143850872929","name":"Shirt","hasVariants":true}]},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9618044